### ==================== ユーザー管理 ====================

### ユーザー一覧取得
GET {{localBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users

###
GET {{lightsailBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users

### 
GET {{ecsBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users

### 単一ユーザー取得
GET {{localBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/1

###
GET {{lightsailBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/1

###
GET {{ecsBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/1

### ユーザー登録
POST {{localBaseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test03@example.com",
  "sub": "17441a88-60f1-709b-b7e3-3e3173aca5d62"
}

